    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="page-title">Return & Refund Policy</h1>

      <p>
        At StudyUpIndia, we strive to ensure your satisfaction with every order.
        If you are not entirely satisfied with your purchase, we're here to help
        with easy and transparent return and refund policies.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Return Policy</h2>
      <p>Returns are accepted only under the following conditions:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>You received a damaged or defective product.</li>
        <li>You received an incorrect item.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        To be eligible for a return, the item must be unused and in its original
        condition with all packaging and tags intact. Requests for return must
        be initiated within <strong>3 days</strong> of receiving the product.
      </p>

      <h2>2. How to Request a Return</h2>
      <p>
        To request a return, please email us at
        <a href="mailto:studyupindia1@gmail.com">studyupindia1@gmail.com</a>
        with the following details:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Order ID</li>
        <li>Reason for return</li>
        <li>
          Photographs of the item (in case of damage or incorrect product)
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Once your request is received and verified, our support team will
        contact you with further instructions.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Refunds</h2>
      <p>
        Once we receive your returned item, we will inspect it and notify you of
        the status. If your return is approved, a refund will be initiated to
        your original method of payment.
      </p>

      <p>
        If you cancel any order after we have procured the items but before
        shipping, a <strong>restocking fee</strong> will be charged. The
        restocking fee varies depending on the product category and will be
        deducted from the refund amount.
      </p>

      <p>
        Refunds (after deduction, if applicable) will be processed within
        <strong>5 working days</strong>.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Shipping Charges</h2>
      <p>
        Shipping costs are non-refundable. If the return is due to our error
        (wrong or damaged item), we will cover the return shipping. Otherwise,
        you will be responsible for paying your own return shipping costs.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Non-Returnable Items</h2>
      <p>The following items cannot be returned or refunded:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Items damaged after delivery</li>
        <li>Customized or personalized orders</li>
        <li>Items without original packaging or in used condition</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about our Return and Refund Policy, feel free
        to contact us at:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Email:
          <a href="mailto:studyupindia1@gmail.com">studyupindia1@gmail.com</a>
        </li>
        <li>Phone: +91 9868505044</li>
      </ul>
